    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\udded <strong>About This Game</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A bee doesn't only fight for honey... sometimes it flies for love.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take control of a brave bee whose queen has been captured by dark forces. Fight through danger, survive chaotic roads, complete hidden missions, and save your colony's future!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udee3 <strong>4 unique roads</strong>, each filled with deadly vehicles and obstacles.<br>\ud83d\udddd <strong>Find 3 hidden keys</strong> to unlock the final gateway.<br>\ud83c\udfaf <strong>25+ achievements and missions</strong> to track your progress.<br>\ud83d\ude97 <strong>Evade enemies, gather shields, collect health pickups.</strong><br>\ud83c\udf0d Fully localized with <strong>multi-language support</strong>.<br>\ud83c\udf1f Integrated with <strong>Steam Achievements</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde0 <strong>Fast reflexes, sharp focus, and tactical decisions</strong> are essential.<br>Every run brings you one step closer to becoming the ultimate bee hero!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\udded <strong>About This Game</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A bee doesn't only fight for honey... sometimes it flies for love.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take control of a brave bee whose queen has been captured by dark forces. Fight through danger, survive chaotic roads, complete hidden missions, and save your colony's future!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udee3 <strong>4 unique roads</strong>, each filled with deadly vehicles and obstacles.<br>\ud83d\udddd <strong>Find 3 hidden keys</strong> to unlock the final gateway.<br>\ud83c\udfaf <strong>25+ achievements and missions</strong> to track your progress.<br>\ud83d\ude97 <strong>Evade enemies, gather shields, collect health pickups.</strong><br>\ud83c\udf0d Fully localized with <strong>multi-language support</strong>.<br>\ud83c\udf1f Integrated with <strong>Steam Achievements</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde0 <strong>Fast reflexes, sharp focus, and tactical decisions</strong> are essential.<br>Every run brings you one step closer to becoming the ultimate bee hero!</p>",
